{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24106","headline":"因梦有悟 · 白居易","name":"因梦有悟","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"交友沦殁尽，悠悠劳梦思。\n平生所厚者，昨夜梦见之。\n梦中几许事，枕上无多时。\n欵曲数杯酒，从容一局碁。\n初见韦尚书，金紫何辉辉。\n中遇李侍郎，笑言甚怡怡。\n终爲崔常侍，意色苦依依。\n一夕三改变，梦心不惊疑。\n此事人尽怪，此理谁得知。\n我粗知此理，闻於竺乾师。\n识行妄分别，智隐迷是非。\n若转识爲智，菩提其庶几。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24106.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24106","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}